openbsm (21+ds3-3) blueberry-pie-os; urgency=medium

  * Build-Depend on pietoolchain-host and pietoolchain-sdk.
  * The auditd postinst records the mode of /var/audit as a dpkg
    statoverride, so it can be made again where the package does not create
    it. A purge removes the record. auditd depends on base-files, whose
    /etc/group gives the record its group name when the postinst runs in
    an image build.

